<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.54 vs   1.11</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.58 vs   1.54</p>
